<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · region</p><h1 class="enc-title">Eritrea</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Eritrea is a country in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/horn-of-africa">Horn of Africa</a> on the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/red-sea">Red Sea</a> coast. The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/aksumite-empire">Aksumite Empire</a>'s port of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/adulis">Adulis</a> lay there, and from the late nineteenth century it became <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/italy">Italy</a>'s first colony and a base for the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/italian-empire">Italian Empire</a>'s invasion of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/ethiopia">Ethiopia</a>. It gained independence in 1993.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/eritrea.jpg" alt="Eritrea" width="320" height="160" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Unknown authorUnknown author · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Flag_of_Eritrea.svg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
